{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01027","headline":"相和歌辞 箜篌引 · 李贺","name":"相和歌辞 箜篌引","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公乎公乎，提壶将焉如？\n屈平沈湘不足慕，徐衍入海诚爲愚。\n公乎公乎，牀有菅席盘有鱼。\n北里有贤兄，东邻有小姑。\n陇亩油油黍与葫，瓦甒浊醪蚁浮浮。\n黍可食，醪可饮，公乎公乎其奈居。\n被发奔流竟何如？贤兄小姑哭呜呜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01027.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01027","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}